---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' https://forum.plantuml.net/20492
' With "stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node" a transition label is its own node.
' Hiding Faulted must drop the "fault" label too, not leave it dangling.
skinparam stateDiagramEdgeLabelStyle node

state Idle
state Charging
state Faulted $fault

Idle --> Charging : start
Charging --> Faulted : fault

hide $fault
@enduml
